      "title": "A Kingdom Built on Forgery",
      "prose": "The false treaty holds — for now. Lady Ysenne rules atop a lie only you and the envoy know, a debt owed forever to your silence.",
      "art": "art-the-unpaid-crown-ending-shadow-rule",
      "options": [],
